### Generated documents ###
# Confirmation letters are no longer written to disk — they go to a private
# Cloudflare R2 bucket — so there is no local directory to ignore. `storage/` is
# still listed because an older checkout may have one, and confirmation letters
# contain a customer's name, the bonds they bought and what they paid: they must
# never be committed.
